PATTERN RECOGNITION CHEAT SHEET

- Pair sum equals target: HashMap or Two Pointers
- Longest/shortest contiguous subarray: Sliding Window or Prefix Sum
- Repeated range sums: Prefix Sum, Fenwick Tree or Segment Tree
- Sorted array or monotonic condition: Binary Search or Two Pointers
- Next greater element: Monotonic Stack
- Top K elements: Heap or Quickselect
- Generate all combinations: Backtracking
- Repeated recursive states: Dynamic Programming or Memoization
- Shortest path in unweighted graph: BFS
- Shortest path with nonnegative weights: Dijkstra
- Connectivity after merging groups: Union-Find
- Tasks with dependencies: Topological Sort
- Overlapping time intervals: Sorting or Sweep Line
- Prefix-based word search: Trie
- Range queries with updates: Fenwick Tree or Segment Tree
- Cycle in linked list: Fast and Slow Pointers
- Optimization with many choices: DP, Greedy or Binary Search on Answer
- Very large input streams: Streaming or Online Algorithms


