STUDY METHOD
- Understand the pattern first.
- Solve 2 easy problems.
- Solve 3–5 medium problems.
- Practice mixed problems.
- Analyze time and space complexity.
- Implement solutions in Java.
- Revisit problems you could not solve independently.

